    "description": "<p>Every target within 4.5 m of the caster tests Will against the caster's Will.</p><p><strong>On the caster's success:</strong> the target is Stunned for one round, then Staggered for another.</p><p><strong>On failure:</strong> the target is Staggered for one round.</p><p>Interrupts physical attacks.</p><p>Can be cast as a Reaction only when the caster is attacked.</p>",
